<title>UK: Frankfurt Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark April 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt Hypo sets 1.0 bln mark April 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Caisse de Depots et Consignations, Deutsche Bank, DB Bank and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURT HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.75	MATURITY    12.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.665    PAY DATE  S-12.NOV.96</p>
<p>FULL FEES  27.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6 BP	SELL CONC  21.5 BP   PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF NO 705</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
